{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0050-4000-8000-000000000000",
    "name": "Encargalo - Orders",
    "description": "Endpoints de órdenes. Requieren cookie `encargalo-session`. Create Order: rol Customer. Manager WebSocket: Customer u Order Manager.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get Payment Methods",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/payment-methods",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["payment-methods"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna los métodos de pago activos. PagoMovil incluye `qr_url` y los campos requeridos. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Order (EfectivoBs / EfectivoDolar)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"shop_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7\",\n  \"method_payment\": \"EfectivoBs\",\n  \"delivery_fee\": 5000,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"address\": \"Av. Principal, Caracas\",\n    \"latitude\": 10.488801,\n    \"longitude\": -66.879190\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa8\",\n      \"amount\": 2,\n      \"observation\": \"Sin cebolla\",\n      \"flavors\": {},\n      \"additions\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Crea una orden en efectivo. `method_payment` acepta `EfectivoBs` o `EfectivoDolar`. Al aceptar pasa directo a In Preparation. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Rol: Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Order (PagoMovil)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"shop_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7\",\n  \"method_payment\": \"PagoMovil\",\n  \"pago_movil_data\": {\n    \"nombre\": \"Juan Pérez\",\n    \"cedula\": \"V-12345678\",\n    \"telefono\": \"0412-1234567\",\n    \"banco\": \"Banco de Venezuela\"\n  },\n  \"payment_proof_image\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgAB...\",\n  \"delivery_fee\": 5000,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"address\": \"Av. Principal, Caracas\",\n    \"latitude\": 10.488801,\n    \"longitude\": -66.879190\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa8\",\n      \"amount\": 2,\n      \"observation\": \"\",\n      \"flavors\": {},\n      \"additions\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Crea una orden con Pago Móvil. Requiere `pago_movil_data` y `payment_proof_image` (base64). El comprobante se sube a Cloudinary. La respuesta incluye `payment_qr_url`. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Rol: Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirm Pickup (Shop → On The Way)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/:id/confirm-pickup",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", ":id", "confirm-pickup"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
              "description": "UUID del pedido"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "El local introduce el código de 6 dígitos que le muestra el rider. Si el código es válido, el pedido pasa de 'In Preparation' o 'Ready' a 'On The Way' y se genera el código de entrega para el usuario. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Roles: Order Manager, Owner."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirm Delivery (Rider → Completed)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"654321\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/:id/confirm-delivery",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", ":id", "confirm-delivery"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
              "description": "UUID del pedido"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "El rider introduce el código de 6 dígitos que le muestra el usuario. Si el código es válido, el pedido pasa de 'On The Way' a 'Completed'. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Rol: Rider."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders Manager WebSocket",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Connection",
            "value": "Upgrade"
          },
          {
            "key": "Upgrade",
            "value": "websocket"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/manager",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", "manager"]
        },
        "description": "WebSocket para el gestor de órdenes en tiempo real. Conectar con ws:// en lugar de http://. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Roles: Customer, Order Manager.\n\nNOTA: Para probar WebSockets en Postman, crea una nueva request de tipo WebSocket con la URL: ws://localhost:3000/orders/manager"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Rider WebSocket",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Connection",
            "value": "Upgrade"
          },
          {
            "key": "Upgrade",
            "value": "websocket"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/rider",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", "rider"]
        },
        "description": "WebSocket exclusivo para el rol Rider. Al conectar el rider entra al pool de disponibles y recibe sus órdenes activas con `pickup_code`.\n\nNOTA: Para probar, crea una request de tipo WebSocket con la URL: ws://localhost:3000/orders/rider\n\nMensajes entrantes:\n- accept_order: {\"type\":\"accept_order\",\"order_id\":\"<uuid>\"}\n\nMensajes salientes:\n- {\"type\":\"connected\"}\n- {\"type\":\"new_order\",\"order\":{...}} — orden disponible (sin códigos)\n- {\"type\":\"order_accepted\",\"order\":{...}} — asignación exitosa (con pickup_code)\n- {\"type\":\"order_taken\",\"order_id\":\"<uuid>\"} — otro rider se adelantó\n- {\"type\":\"order_update\",\"order\":{...}} — actualización de orden asignada (con pickup_code)\n- {\"type\":\"error\",\"message\":\"...\"}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
